            <ArticleTitle>DIA is not a new mass spectrometry acquisition method.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/pmic.201700017</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Contrary to what is being said by several colleagues (and even advertised), data-independent analysis/acquisition (DIA) is not a new mass spectrometry acquisition method. Here we draw a timeline of events showing that DIA has been around since the early 2000s.</AbstractText>
